---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base lang="zh" title="空想花庭 · 复旦大学空想世界创作者协会"
      description="乐园搁浅在不毛之地，花仍在开。复旦大学空想世界创作者协会同人网站。"
      active="about" themeClass="home" headerClass="over-abyss" canvas="vigil">

<section class="vigil">
  <div class="vigil-content">
    <svg class="big-halo" viewBox="0 0 130 130" aria-hidden="true">
      <ellipse cx="65" cy="65" rx="52" ry="20" transform="rotate(-14 65 65)"/>
      <ellipse class="inner" cx="65" cy="65" rx="38" ry="14" transform="rotate(10 65 65)"/>
    </svg>
    <h1 class="vigil-title" data-kinetic>空想花庭</h1>
    <div class="vigil-latin">HORTUS&nbsp;DE&nbsp;ESCAPISMO</div>
    <div class="vigil-ticker" data-ticker="SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · SIGNAL LOST · 60 YEARS||HORTUS DE ESCAPISMO · THE GARDEN ENDURES||共感 LINK ESTABLISHED · WELCOME, PILGRIM"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 卷一 · sentences scattered across the night map; hover to illuminate -->
  <span class="scatter" style="top:24%;left:9%">这里是复旦大学空想世界创作者协会。</span>
  <span class="scatter" style="top:33%;right:8%">「想象」为我们的唯一院规。</span>
  <span class="scatter" style="top:47%;left:14%">小说、画作、角色、世界，皆是院中人的手笔。</span>
  <span class="scatter" style="top:58%;right:12%">修道院虽于荒野搁浅，然繁花盛开。</span>
  <span class="scatter" style="top:70%;left:20%">你巡礼于黎明前的回廊。</span>
  <span class="scatter" style="top:80%;right:22%">向下——向下——朝圣手札苏醒之地。</span>

  <div class="scroll-cue">SCROLL · 拾阶而下</div>
</section>

<div class="walk">

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA PRIMA · THE FRIARS</div>
    <a class="door" href="/members/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="17" r="7"/><path d="M10 40 C10 31 16 27 24 27 C32 27 38 31 38 40"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 data-scramble="住客名录">住客名录</h3>
        <div class="meta">卷一 · 住客</div>
        <p>这座花庭的住客——现世的灵魂，自会描摹出异世的花苗，抽芽，绽放，自成天地。</p>
        <span class="enter">推门而入 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="band" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET · PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET ·&nbsp;</span>
    <span>PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET · PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET ·&nbsp;</span>
  </div>

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA SECUNDA · THE CHRONICLE</div>
    <a class="door rev" href="/activities/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8 h20 l4 6 v26 h-24 z"/><path d="M32 8 v6 h4 M17 20 h14 M17 27 h14 M17 34 h9"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 data-scramble="活动志">活动志</h3>
        <div class="meta">卷二 · 编年</div>
        <p>花庭之编年史——院墙内发生的一切，磐石镌刻，任风月无常。</p>
        <span class="enter">推门而入 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="band" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS · SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS ·&nbsp;</span>
    <span>SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS · SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS ·&nbsp;</span>
  </div>

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA TERTIA · THE GARDEN</div>
    <a class="door" href="/works/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 6 C20 14 14 18 8 19 C14 20 20 24 24 32 C28 24 34 20 40 19 C34 18 28 14 24 6 Z"/><path d="M24 32 L24 42"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 data-scramble="花庭">花庭</h3>
        <div class="meta">卷三 · 造物</div>
        <p>空想者的造物——汝可知想象之伟力，世轻慢之以空想，笑对，还以浮世无尽。</p>
        <span class="enter">推门而入 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="walk-inner epilogue">
    <section class="section-title reveal"><h2>我们是誰</h2></section>
    <div class="card reveal">
      <p>「花庭」之名取自《明日方舟》SideStory〈空想花庭 Hortus de Escapismo〉：一座搁浅于荒野的移动修道院里，萨科塔仍日复一日地种花。我们相信创作的意义与之相同——不求乐土，但求一畦花居。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card reveal" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
      <p>同道者：带上你的「空想」。小说节与OC展每年定期开放，详情见<a href="/activities/">活动志</a>；日常交流请关注公众号「空想花庭」。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<Footer lang="zh" mid="index" />
</Base>
